00%);\n    border: 3px solid #111;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #333;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .ph-intro { width: 100%; height: 200px; margin: 0 0 25px 0; }\n  .ph-materials { width: 100%; height: 110px; margin-top: 10px; }\n  .ph-small-row { display: flex; gap: 14px; margin: 14px 0 20px 0; }\n  .ph-small { flex: 1; height: 115px; }\n  .ph-figure {\n    width: 100%; height: 240px;\n    background: linear-gradient(#cfe9f7 0%, #cfe9f7 60%, #8cbf3f 60%, #6da62f 100%);\n    border: 3px solid #111; border-radius: 16px;\n    display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px; color: #333; text-align: center; padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .results-row { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; }\n  .results-text { flex: 1; }\n  .results-fig { flex: 0 0 40%; }\n  .concl-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; }\n  .concl-box { flex: 1; }\n  .concl-fig {\n    flex: 0 0 34%; height: 210px;\n    border: 3px solid #111; border-radius: 16px;\n    background: #eef6ea;\n    display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px; color: #333; text-align: center; padding: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"board\">\n\n  <div class=\"col col-left\">\n    <h2>Introduction<br>and Hypothesis</h2>\n    <p>What is your science fair project all about? Share your question and prediction.</p>\n    <div class=\"placeholder ph-intro\">[Illustration: student with lightbulb idea, landscape background — left column, centered]</div>\n    <h2>Materials</h2>\n    <p>Did you use any specific items for your project?</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Use bullet points</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"placeholder ph-materials\">[Image: green hills landscape — bottom of left column]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col col-mid\">\n    <div class=\"title\">My Science<br>Project title